From 7fffbec570692c925cbf1f58ea9b1cd1a5d78ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:16:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ARM: configs: enable Tizen RPi4 AutoFDO training

Enable AutoFDO in the existing BCM2711 defconfig merged by the spec
for the regular and RT builds. Keep CONFIG_LOCALVERSION and the
existing target-specific localversion file as the release prefix.

Allow an optional kernel_localversion RPM macro to set LOCALVERSION
in both spec phases and extend the modules package paths. The old
paths end in -v7l or -v8 and would miss modules with a build suffix.
Use -kbase for the training build so its modules can coexist with
the original release. An unset macro preserves the existing paths.

Signed-off-by: Hao Lin <hao.lin@samsung.com>
---
 arch/arm/configs/tizen_bcm2711_defconfig |  1 +
 packaging/linux-rpi.spec                 | 10 ++++++----
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/tizen_bcm2711_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/tizen_bcm2711_defconfig
index e8bb00b4a8b3..4545075fd962 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/tizen_bcm2711_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/tizen_bcm2711_defconfig
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-v7l"
+CONFIG_AUTOFDO_CLANG=y
 # CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
 CONFIG_SYSVIPC=y
 CONFIG_POSIX_MQUEUE=y
diff --git a/packaging/linux-rpi.spec b/packaging/linux-rpi.spec
index 7002e2296e0b..8b14be76d64f 100644
--- a/packaging/linux-rpi.spec
+++ b/packaging/linux-rpi.spec
@@ -159,6 +159,7 @@ for building and running eBPF-based monitoring and instrumentation.
 cp %{SOURCE1001} .
 
 %build
+%{?kernel_localversion:export LOCALVERSION="%{kernel_localversion}"}
 %{?asan:/usr/bin/gcc-unforce-options}
 %{?ubsan:/usr/bin/gcc-unforce-options}
 
@@ -229,6 +230,7 @@ for target in %{variant} %{variant}-rt; do
 done
 
 %install
+%{?kernel_localversion:export LOCALVERSION="%{kernel_localversion}"}
 QA_SKIP_BUILD_ROOT="DO_NOT_WANT"; export QA_SKIP_BUILD_ROOT
 
 %{?_toolchain:
@@ -350,16 +352,16 @@ mv /boot/zImage /boot/zImage_rt
 
 %files -n %{variant}-linux-kernel-modules
 %ifarch aarch64
-/lib/modules/*%{variant}-v8/
+/lib/modules/*%{variant}-v8%{?kernel_localversion}/
 %else
-/lib/modules/*%{variant}-v7l/
+/lib/modules/*%{variant}-v7l%{?kernel_localversion}/
 %endif
 
 %files -n %{variant}-rt-linux-kernel-modules
 %ifarch aarch64
-/lib/modules/*%{variant}-rt-v8/
+/lib/modules/*%{variant}-rt-v8%{?kernel_localversion}/
 %else
-/lib/modules/*%{variant}-rt-v7l/
+/lib/modules/*%{variant}-rt-v7l%{?kernel_localversion}/
 %endif
 
 %files -n %{variant}-linux-kernel-devel
